        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PCF150SBR, 1-1/2\" Pacific Acrylic Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-1/2 Inch Acrylic Door Pull with Hourglass Mounts is available in clear or frosted acrylic. Choose from a huge selection of sizes ranging from 18 inches to 84 inches. The brackets are made from brass and are available in a wide selection of finishes. This 1-1/2 inch Pacific Acrylic Door Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions PCF150SBR Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PCF04-specifications.pdf?v=1704262300\"><b>First Impressions PCF150SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>PCF150018SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>PCF150024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>PCF150036SBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>PCF150048SBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\" VALIGN=\"top\" >\r\n<b>PCF150060SBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 60\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>PCF150072SBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 72\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 54\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>PCF150084SBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 84\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 54\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—  it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application in lengths up to 6 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1-1/2 Inch Acrylic Door Pull with Hourglass Mounts",
                "description": "The 1-1/2 Inch Acrylic Door Pull with Hourglass Mounts is available in clear or frosted acrylic. Choose from a huge selection of sizes ranging from 18 inches to 84 inches. The brackets are made from brass and are available in a wide selection of finishes. This 1-1/2 inch Pacific Acrylic Door Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n",
